        },
        {
          "text": "na akamĩetee ana ma Aluni athembi; na akaute ũvĩ wake wa ũla mũtu mũvinyu wayo, na amwe ma mauta mayo, vamwe na ũvumba w’onthe wayo. Na mũthembi akamĩvĩvĩsye kĩthembeonĩ yĩthĩwe ũlilikan’yo wayo, nthembo ĩvĩvaw’a na mwaki, yĩ mũuke mũseo kwa Yeova: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
